# Gacha drop % (`/bt` banner timeline)

Published cache: `data/published/official_gasha/gasha_proportion_{gashaId}_{langNum}.json`.

Official detail page (only `gasha_id` changes):

```text
https://web.gl.eternal.channel.or.jp/en/gasha/detail.html?gasha_id={GASHA_ID}
```

CDN API (what the app syncs):

```text
https://web.gl.eternal.channel.or.jp/server_assets/api/gasha_proportion_{gashaId}_{langNum}.json
```

## After a new banner in MasterData

Runs automatically as part of the default post-import workflow:

```text
python scripts/refresh_whats_new_snapshot.py
```

Or published caches only:

```text
python scripts/refresh_published_after_master.py
```

The sync script unions official `gasha_list` + all `m_gasha.json` ids — no manual gasha_id.

Commit new/updated files under `data/published/official_gasha/` before deploy.

## Runtime

`gasha_official_rates.load_official_proportion` lazy-fetches missing proportion JSON from the CDN on first `/api/banner_timeline` hit, then caches locally. Prefer the sync script before ship so production does not depend on live fetch.
